The first creature to emerge looked almost human, except its eyes contained swirling galaxies instead of pupils. It carried an ancient brass key the size of a sword and spoke in a language no one understood, yet every person heard the same message in their mind: "You have seven days." Panic spread across the world as more figures appeared on the staircase, each carrying strange objects that seemed impossible—a compass that pointed to memories, a lantern filled with lightning, and a book whose pages turned by themselves. Then, without warning, the sky cracked open like glass, revealing a second Earth floating above the first.
